        "Content": "Visit dngflanaganford.ie to register your interest & to see current offers, or place an offer on this property (please note offers can be placed once your registration has been approved, subject to conditions).\r\n\r\nPresented to the market in excellent decorative order throughout, No. 23 Carton Heights is a beautifully maintained, owner occupied, three bedroom end of row family home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen dining room, living room, utility room and garage at ground floor, with three bedrooms and a family bathroom at first floor level.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen/dining room enjoys a lovely west facing aspect with late evening sunshine, while the living room faces east for bright morning light. The garage provides potential for additional living or bedroom space at ground floor level, subject to planning.\r\n\r\nOutside there is a neat front garden, a generous private rear garden with mature shrubs and hedge boundary, and off street car parking to the front. PVC double glazed windows throughout. Oil-fired central heating with wall mounted radiators. Owner occupied and very well maintained. Early viewing is strongly recommended.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n23 Carton Heights is superbly positioned in a well established and highly sought after residential estate. The estate benefits from an attractive mature green area with established trees to the front. This is an end of row position with a generous site, added privacy, and side access.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n4.00m x 1.80m (13.12ft x 5.91ft)\r\nCarpet flooring. Stairwell with storage under stairs.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n5.50m x 3.60m (18.04ft x 11.81ft)\r\nLino flooring (kitchen area); timber flooring (dining area). Fully fitted kitchen. French doors to living room. West-facing outlook to rear garden. Storeroom off. Access to utility room.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.00m x 3.60m (13.12ft x 11.81ft)\r\nCarpet flooring. Open fireplace. East-facing aspect. French doors to kitchen/dining room. Overlooks front garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n2.70m x 3.70m (8.86ft x 12.14ft)\r\nPlumbed for washing machine. Door to rear yard. Access to garage.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n2.90m x 1.40m (9.51ft x 4.59ft)\r\nLaminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.20m x 3.70m (10.50ft x 12.14ft)\r\nTimber flooring. Built-in wardrobes. West-facing aspect overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.20m x 3.80m (10.50ft x 12.47ft)\r\nTimber flooring. Built-in wardrobes. Outlook over large mature green area to front.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.90m x 2.30m (9.51ft x 7.55ft)\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Built-in wardrobes. Overlooks front garden and green area. Generous proportions for a third bedroom.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.80m x 2.20m (5.91ft x 7.22ft)\r\nFully tiled around bath area. Toilet, wash-hand basin and bath. Electric shower over bath."
      },
